ry","decision_margin":null,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["1 criterion line(s) bundle multiple deliverables with 'and' (split so each is independently verifiable)."],"finding":"Acceptance-criteria / definition-of-done quality issues.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f607dd457c67f9209","impact":0.4,"is_primary":null,"location":"","norm_id":"ned06ebc801a522e3","priority":0.4,"reason":null,"recalled":false,"scenarios":[],"severity":"minor","suggested_fix":"Split compound criteria, replace subjective terms with observable outcomes, and state how each is verified.","tier":"DET","validity":1.0,"verification":null},{"block_threshold":0.95,"blocking_enabled":false,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Capture the coordinated-create cutover and the internal rollback selector semantics in an ADR / AGENTS.md / design-doc note.","cohort":["COH","E1","E2","E6","F1","T2","T4","T5b","T5e"],"criteria":["T5e"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":-0.95,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Step 4: 'switch the internal create-family default' introduces the coordinator route as the authoritative create path — a novel contract.","No mention of documenting the coordinator/rollback-selector decision."],"finding":"The plan makes coordinated create authoritative (a new pattern/contract) but does not capture this architectural decision in an ADR / AGENTS.md / design-doc update.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f747591914a5e02ad","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Plan step 4","norm_id":"n852ccb1d16a89280","priority":0.0,"reason":"veto:absence-refuted","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A later maintainer sees both a legacy value and a coordinator route and cannot tell which is authoritative or how the rollback selector is intended to be used."],"severity":"none","suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.2857,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"no","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_r